1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
After high-stress moments, people remember the same event in completely different ways.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000
When assumptions mix with facts, clarity disappears.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Proof helps you capture neutral facts first—who, where, when.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Then your evidence and notes are organized into one timestamped timeline.

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:30,000
When memory shifts, your record stays consistent. Facts win.
